   $q$What does Dr. Morales's statement "They are inconvenient. Those are different problems" contribute to the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that Dr. Morales is annoyed that Halima has wasted his time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"It tells Halima that she should repeat the whole experiment before the symposium.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"It separates real evidence of error from mere disappointment, so data may not be dropped just for disagreeing.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It suggests that Halima's experiment was poorly designed from the start.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It separates real evidence of error from mere disappointment, so data may not be dropped just for disagreeing.$q$, $q$He distinguishes contamination, a real reason to remove data, from data that simply disappoint, which is the core of the honesty theme. His calm questions and nod do not show annoyance.$q$, 'draft', '6e07af05-c302-5308-bdee-146ba797d760')
