  ('1874f45e-6487-509a-bea8-2ef6e632bfa7', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-theme-summary'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which statement best expresses a central theme of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Children care more about colors and stickers than about anything useful.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"},{"text":"Engineers should never change a design once they have tested it carefully.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Good design serves the real life and choices of the person who uses it, not just measurable performance.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Printed prosthetic hands are cheaper to make than traditional ones.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Good design serves the real life and choices of the person who uses it, not just measurable performance.$q$, $q$The stronger hand sits unused, while the lighter purple one is worn all afternoon, and Ji-ho's new rule says to ask the wearer. Amara's lightness request is practical, so she does not care only about colors.$q$, 'draft', '94c40bda-aadc-5df1-9bef-f79653aa3c85')
